<h3><u>Maa meri pyaari maa</u></h3>
                <div style=""width:100%"">
                                <p><p>Ae maa ae maa ae maa pyaari maa..(2)<br />
Maa meri pyaari maa pas bula le maa</p>

<p>1. Waqt e shahadat aa pohcha hai<br />
khanjar qatil bhi pyasa hai<br />
pyaas bujhane tegh sitam ki<br />
tera lahu maqtal jaata hai<br />
hota hu ghar se rawaa..<br />
paas bulale maa</p>

<p>2. Tere seene par sar rakh kar<br />
soye hue barso beete hai<br />
god me sou teri jaise<br />
jhule me bache sote hai<br />
chaahiye mujhko amaaan<br />
paas bulale maa</p>

<p>3. Laasho par laashe laaya hu<br />
maqtal se mai tanha amma<br />
dil me nahi hai taqat mere<br />
uth ta nahi hai sadma amma<br />
khushk hai meri zabaa<br />
paas bulale maa</p>

<p>4. Chalni hua akbar ka kaleja<br />
seene me toota hai naiza<br />
noor gaya mere ankho ka<br />
milta nahi hai mujhko rasta<br />
margaya kadiyal jawaa<br />
paas bulale maa</p>

<p>5. Baali sakina rok rahi hai<br />
maqtal me jaane nahi deti<br />
kiske seene par soyegi<br />
amma meri pyaari beti<br />
uspe karo ehsaa<br />
paas bulale maa</p>

<p>6. Meri behen zainab wo khadi hai<br />
khaime ke dar se dekh rahi hai<br />
sabr khuda de meri behen ko<br />
amma dua do sakht ghadi hai<br />
roti hai sab bibiya<br />
paas bulale maa</p>

<p>7. Muh ko chupa lo baalo se apne<br />
dekh sakogi kese ye manzar<br />
kese sahogi dekh ke amma<br />
apne pisar ke halq pe khanjar<br />
hota hai khanjar rawa<br />
paas bulale maa</p>

<p>8. Kehte the farhan ye sarwar<br />
mai to hu rehan e risalat<br />
zakhm hazaro dil pe uthake<br />
karta raha inkare bay&#39;at<br />
ab hai yahi armaa<br />
paas bulale maa<br />
maa meri pyaari maa pas bula le maa..(2)</p>
</p>
